OL,3,A9/11 victims remembered 25 years on
OL,4,Afrom September 11 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMemorial services will be held today to
OL,7,Fmark the 25th anniversary of the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks in the United States
OL,10,FOn 11 September 2001, 2,977 people were
OL,11,Fkilled when hijackers crashed three
OL,12,Fplanes into the World Trade Center in
OL,13,FNew York City and the Pentagon in
OL,14,FVirginia
OL,16,FA fourth hijacked plane crashed in a
OL,17,Ffield in Pennsylvania after passengers
OL,18,Ffought back
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
